WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
mm2t: Stay in the conversation. Let mm2t take the notes.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
All your meetings, together in one place.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
A menu bar capsule detects your meeting and offers to record.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Name the speakers and follow the timestamped transcript.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Review key points, decisions, and next steps.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Save voiceprints to recognize familiar speakers next time.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Add specialist terms to your personal vocabulary.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Bring your own API keys or connect a self-hosted transcription server.

00:36.000 --> 00:44.000
mm2t: Free and open source. Made for macOS.
